  "body": "Querying for the display name of someone who does not have a display name gets you `{displayname: null}`, however if you query for a field that does not exist you get `{}`. Likewise, the full profile for a user that has nothing set is `{displayname: null, avatar_url: null}`. \r\n\r\nShould decide on whether `null` is used, or just omitting the properties.",
